00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:04.420
[Wren] Eh, that's unfortunate. Hopefully that doesn't add too much more time to my travel,

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:11.360
This is a big detour. I don't know how much extra distance this is going to add to my trip.

00:08:11.399 --> 00:08:16.189
But that being said, now I have to figure out my way to work on the LA streets. Uh, okay

00:08:18.569 --> 00:08:24.558
Here I am about nine miles into the ride and I'm walking up a hill because the Boosted Board can't handle my weight on such

00:08:24.559 --> 00:08:29.208
