00:08:31.099 --> 00:08:35.119
I just need more batteries in parallel to properly do this. Here's what I don't get.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.669
I'm actually getting pretty good readings from the multimeter.

00:08:38.279 --> 00:08:41.809
35.6 and then 36 even for the right battery pack

00:08:42.209 --> 00:08:47.568
which means that all the battery packs are at the same voltage, and I still have a fair amount of charge left in them.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:52.699
So why am I not getting the current draw that I want? I still got another several miles to go

00:08:52.699 --> 00:08:54.699
so hopefully I'll be able to make it.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:59.420
I'm about three and a half miles away from studio now

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:04.160
